<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="header" id="top"><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Saanjh home"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="" width="48" height="48"><span>saanjh<span class="brand-dot">.</span><small>INDIAN KITCHEN & COURTYARD</small></span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation" id="nav"><a href="#story">Our story</a><a href="#menu">The menu</a><a href="#menu-card">Menu card</a><a href="#space">The courtyard</a><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a></nav><a class="button button-outline header-book" href="#reserve"><span>A table for you</span><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a><button class="mobile-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav" aria-label="Open navigation"><span></span><span></span></button></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
 <div class="hero-photo"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A warmly lit Indian courtyard restaurant with teak tables, cane chairs and leafy trees" fetchpriority="high" width="1536" height="1024"></div><div class="hero-shade"></div>
 <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="small-sun">✳</span> THE GOOD KIND OF INDIAN</p><h1 id="hero-title"><span>A little spice.</span><span>A lot of <i>soul.</i></span></h1><p class="hero-description">Familiar flavours. Unhurried evenings.<br/>And always, a little room for one more.</p><a class="button button-cream" href="#menu"><span>Find your favourites</span><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div>
 <div class="hero-note" aria-label="Made with patience. Served with love."><svg class="stamp-lettering" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="hero-ring-top" d="M25 100 A75 75 0 0 1 175 100"/><path id="hero-ring-bottom" d="M25 105 A75 75 0 0 0 175 105"/></defs><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="94"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="88"/><text><textPath href="#hero-ring-top" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">MADE WITH PATIENCE</textPath></text><text class="stamp-bottom"><textPath href="#hero-ring-bottom" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">SERVED WITH LOVE</textPath></text></svg><span class="note-mark">✳</span></div>
 <div class="hero-bottom"><span>INDIAN ROOTS. OPEN ARMS.</span><a href="#intro" aria-label="Scroll to discover Saanjh">A taste of what’s to come <svg><use href="#down"/></svg></a></div>
</section>
<div class="ribbon" aria-hidden="true"><div>FROM THE TANDOOR <span>✳</span> FOR THE TABLE <span>✳</span> STRAIGHT FROM THE HEART <span>✳</span> FROM THE TANDOOR <span>✳</span> FOR THE TABLE <span>✳</span> STRAIGHT FROM THE HEART <span>✳</span></div></div>
<section class="intro section" id="intro"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>01 / WELCOME TO SAANJH</span><span class="tiny-line"></span></div><h2 class="reveal">Some meals fill a plate.<br>Ours bring people <i>together.</i></h2><div class="intro-bottom reveal"><img class="intro-symbol" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Saanjh sunset emblem" width="84" height="84"><p>A proper Indian meal is never just about the food. It’s the passing of plates. The last piece of naan. The stories that run longer than dinner. That’s the feeling we’re cooking for.</p><a class="text-link" href="#story">Meet our kitchen <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div></section>
<section class="menu-section section" id="menu" aria-labelledby="menu-title"><div class="menu-heading"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow ink">02 / FROM OUR KITCHEN</p><h2 id="menu-title">Your kind<br> of <i>comfort.</i></h2></div><div class="menu-heading-right reveal"><p>A few classics. A few discoveries.<br>Everything made for another helping.</p><div class="diet-legend"><span><i class="diet veg" aria-hidden="true"></i> Vegetarian</span><span><i class="diet nonveg" aria-hidden="true"></i> Non-vegetarian</span></div></div></div>
<div class="menu-controls"><div class="menu-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Menu categories"><button class="active" id="tab-all" data-filter="all" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="menu-grid" tabindex="0"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#menu-icon"/></svg><span>All dishes</span><b data-count="all">08</b></button><button id="tab-starters" data-filter="starters" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="menu-grid" tabindex="-1"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#flame"/></svg><span>Starters</span><b data-count="starters">02</b></button><button id="tab-mains" data-filter="mains" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="menu-grid" tabindex="-1"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#plate"/></svg><span>Main course</span><b data-count="mains">04</b></button><button id="tab-desserts" data-filter="desserts" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="menu-grid" tabindex="-1"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sweet"/></svg><span>Desserts</span><b data-count="desserts">02</b></button></div><div class="menu-preferences"><label class="veg-only"><input type="checkbox" id="veg-filter"><span class="toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span>Vegetarian only</label><span id="menu-results">8 dishes to discover</span></div></div>
<p class="sr-only" id="menu-status" aria-live="polite">8 dishes shown</p><div class="menu-grid" id="menu-grid" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-all"></div><p class="menu-empty" hidden>No dishes here just yet. Try another category.</p><aside class="gather-banner reveal"><div class="gather-image"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Butter chicken, dal, biryani and fresh naan set for sharing on an ivory courtyard table" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"><span>THE BEST THINGS ARE SHARED.</span></div><div class="gather-copy"><p class="eyebrow ink">YOUR PEOPLE. OUR TABLE.</p><h3>Make it a meal<br><i>to remember.</i></h3><p>A little of everything. A table full of favourites.<br>Bring the people who make it special.</p><a class="button button-red" href="#reserve"><span>Let’s find your table</span><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a><a class="gather-secondary" href="#space">Take a look around <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a><span class="gather-flower" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div></aside><div class="menu-foot"><p>Good food is for everyone. Please ask about ingredients and dietary needs.</p><span>PRICES IN INR · ILLUSTRATIVE MENU</span></div></section>
<section class="menu-reader-section section" id="menu-card" aria-labelledby="reader-title"><div class="experience-heading"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow ink">THE SAANJH MENU CARD</p><h2 id="reader-title">A little browse.<br>A lovely <i>decision.</i></h2></div><div class="experience-intro reveal"><p>Just like the menu at your table.<br>Turn a page. Find your next favourite.</p><button class="text-link" type="button" id="open-menu-reader">Read in full screen <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#expand"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="menu-book-shell reveal"><div class="book-toolbar"><span>INDIAN ROOTS. EVERY PAGE.</span><div class="book-category-nav" aria-label="Menu card chapters"><button type="button" data-book-page="0" aria-pressed="true">Cover</button><button type="button" data-book-page="1" aria-pressed="false">Starters</button><button type="button" data-book-page="2" aria-pressed="false">Mains</button><button type="button" data-book-page="3" aria-pressed="false">Desserts</button></div></div><div class="book-spread" id="inline-book" tabindex="0" aria-label="Interactive Saanjh menu card. Use left and right arrow keys to turn pages."></div><div class="book-pagination"><button type="button" class="round-control previous" data-book-step="-1" aria-label="Previous menu page"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><span class="book-page-status" aria-live="polite">Cover · 01 / 04</span><div class="book-page-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="active"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><button type="button" class="round-control" data-book-step="1" aria-label="Next menu page"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button></div><p class="book-hint">A menu worth taking your time with. <span>Swipe or use the arrows to turn a page.</span></p></div></section>
<section class="story-section section" id="story"><div class="story-image reveal"><div class="story-frame"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A professional chef in a clean ivory jacket carefully finishing a tandoori dish at a spotless kitchen counter" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1536"></div><span class="image-caption">A LITTLE PATIENCE IN EVERY PLATE.</span><div class="story-stamp" aria-label="Good things take their time. Always have, always will."><svg class="stamp-lettering" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="story-ring-top" d="M25 100 A75 75 0 0 1 175 100"/><path id="story-ring-bottom" d="M25 105 A75 75 0 0 0 175 105"/></defs><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="94"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="88"/><text><textPath href="#story-ring-top" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">GOOD THINGS</textPath></text><text class="stamp-bottom"><textPath href="#story-ring-bottom" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">ALWAYS HAVE · ALWAYS WILL</textPath></text></svg><strong>take<br><i>their time.</i></strong></div></div><div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow ink reveal">03 / THE SAANJH WAY</p><h2 class="reveal">No shortcuts.<br>Just <i>good food.</i></h2><p class="story-lead reveal">The kind you remember.<br>The kind you come back for.</p><p class="story-body reveal">Our kitchen is inspired by the things that make Indian food feel like home: spices warmed before they’re ground, gravies given time to settle, and bread that goes straight from the tandoor to your table.</p><a class="text-link reveal" href="#menu">Something’s cooking <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div></section>
<section class="values-section section" aria-label="Seven little details"><div class="values-heading"><p class="eyebrow ink">THE LITTLE THINGS, DONE PROPERLY</p><div class="values-nav"><span>07 little details</span><button type="button" data-values-dir="-1" aria-label="Previous kitchen values"><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><button type="button" data-values-dir="1" aria-label="Next kitchen values"><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="story-values reveal" id="kitchen-values"><div class="value-item"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#spice"/></svg><span>Spice with<br>intention</span></div><div class="value-item"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#flame"/></svg><span>Slow fire.<br>Deep flavour.</span></div><div class="value-item"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#plate"/></svg><span>Plates made<br>for passing</span></div><div class="value-item"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#leaf"/></svg><span>Seasonal<br>ingredients</span></div><div class="value-item"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sun"/></svg><span>Freshly<br>prepared</span></div><div class="value-item"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#heart"/></svg><span>A warmer<br>welcome</span></div><div class="value-item"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sparkle"/></svg><span>Care in<br>every detail</span></div></div></section>
<section class="team-section section" id="people"><div class="team-heading"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow ink">THE PEOPLE WHO MAKE IT FEEL LIKE HOME</p><h2>Good hands.<br><i>Even better hearts.</i></h2></div><p class="reveal">From the first welcome to the final detail,<br>good hospitality is a team effort.</p></div><div class="team-grid"><figure class="team-member reveal"><div class="team-portrait"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="An Indian chef in a crisp ivory jacket and forest green apron in the Saanjh courtyard" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1536"><span>01 / IN THE KITCHEN</span></div><figcaption><h3>Chef Arjun Rao</h3><span>HEAD CHEF</span><p>A little intuition. A lot of care. And a deep love for the flavours of home.</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="team-member reveal"><div class="team-portrait"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="An Indian server in a fresh ivory shirt and tailored forest green uniform holding a brass tray" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1536"><span>02 / AT YOUR TABLE</span></div><figcaption><h3>Meera Nair</h3><span>GUEST EXPERIENCE</span><p>The thoughtful little touches that make a meal feel like an evening with friends.</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="team-member reveal"><div class="team-portrait"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A neatly uniformed Indian housekeeping professional holding freshly folded white table linens" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1536"><span>03 / IN EVERY DETAIL</span></div><figcaption><h3>Ravi Kumar</h3><span>HOUSEKEEPING & CARE</span><p>Fresh linen, a beautifully set table, and a space ready to make you feel at home.</p></figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="feast"><div class="feast-photo"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A generous brass bowl of fragrant chicken dum biryani with raita" loading="lazy" width="1254" height="1254"></div><div class="feast-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE ONE TO GATHER AROUND</p><h2>A little more<br><i>biryani.</i><br>A little less hurry.</h2><p>Fragrant basmati. Saffron. Slow-cooked chicken.<br>Some things are better when you take your time.</p><button class="button button-cream" data-dish="biryani"><span>Meet the dum biryani</span><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><span class="feast-flower" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div></section>
<section class="space-section section" id="space"><div class="space-heading"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow ink">04 / STAY A LITTLE LONGER</p><h2>Good company.<br><i>Better evenings.</i></h2></div><p class="reveal">A courtyard for catching up.<br>A quiet corner for two.<br>A table that feels like yours.</p></div><div class="space-photo reveal"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="The Saanjh courtyard with soft amber lamps, green foliage and intimate dining tables" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"><div class="space-overlay"><span>THE COURTYARD</span><span>Pull up a chair.</span></div><a href="#reserve" class="space-cta" aria-label="Plan an evening in the courtyard"><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="space-caption"><p>For the dinners that turn into stories.</p><span>INDIAN KITCHEN & COURTYARD</span></div></section>
<section class="gallery-section section" id="gallery" aria-labelledby="gallery-title"><div class="experience-heading"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow ink">05 / A GLIMPSE OF SAANJH</p><h2 id="gallery-title">The moments<br>between <i>the meals.</i></h2></div><p class="gallery-heading-copy reveal">The people, the place, the little details.<br>Take a look around before you take a seat.</p></div><div class="gallery-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter gallery photographs"><button type="button" class="active" data-gallery-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All moments <span>10</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-filter="spaces" aria-pressed="false">Our spaces <span>03</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-filter="people" aria-pressed="false">Our people <span>02</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-filter="guests" aria-pressed="false">Around the table <span>03</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-filter="food" aria-pressed="false">Food & little extras <span>02</span></button></div><div class="gallery-viewer reveal" tabindex="0" aria-label="Saanjh photograph gallery. Use left and right arrow keys to browse."><button class="gallery-main-photo" type="button" id="open-gallery" aria-label="Enlarge current gallery photograph"><img id="gallery-featured" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"><span class="gallery-enlarge"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#expand"/></svg> Take a closer look</span></button><div class="gallery-caption"><span class="gallery-counter">01 / 10</span><p class="eyebrow ink" id="gallery-category">OUR SPACES</p><h3 id="gallery-photo-title">Where evenings<br>slow down.</h3><p id="gallery-photo-description">A leafy courtyard, a little lamplight, and a table waiting for you.</p><div class="gallery-controls"><button type="button" class="round-control previous" data-gallery-step="-1" aria-label="Previous gallery photograph"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="round-control" data-gallery-step="1" aria-label="Next gallery photograph"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><span>Stay a little curious.</span></div></div></div><div class="gallery-thumbnails" id="gallery-thumbnails" role="group" aria-label="Choose a gallery photograph"></div><p class="gallery-status sr-only" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
<section class="reserve-section" id="reserve"><div class="reserve-copy"><p class="eyebrow reveal">06 / THERE’S A PLACE FOR YOU</p><h2 class="reveal">Come hungry.<br>Leave <i>happy.</i></h2><p class="reveal">A date, a long-overdue catch-up, or just a craving.<br>Let’s make an evening of it.</p><div class="reserve-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>✳</span><div class="table-line"></div><p>THE BEST SEAT?<br>THE ONE WITH GOOD COMPANY.</p></div></div><div class="reserve-form-wrap reveal"><div class="form-top"><span>MAKE A LITTLE PLAN</span><svg><use href="#sun"/></svg></div><h3>A table for your people.</h3><form id="booking-form"><div class="form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="What should we call you?" required maxlength="70"></label></div><div class="form-row form-row-two"><label>Day<input name="date" type="date" required></label><label>Your people<select name="guests"><option value="2">2 people</option><option value="1">Just me</option><option value="3">3 people</option><option value="4">4 people</option><option value="5">5 people</option><option value="6">6 people</option><option value="7">7 people</option><option value="8">8 people</option></select></label></div><div class="form-row form-row-two"><label>A good time<select name="time"><option>7:00 pm</option><option>12:30 pm</option><option>1:30 pm</option><option>6:30 pm</option><option>7:30 pm</option><option>8:00 pm</option><option>8:30 pm</option><option>9:00 pm</option></select></label><label>Where to sit<select name="seating"><option>The courtyard</option><option>A cosy indoor table</option><option>Surprise me</option></select></label></div><button class="button button-red form-submit" type="submit"><span>Plan a lovely evening</span><svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><p class="form-note">Reservation preview. Your plan stays on this device;<br>no booking will be sent.</p></form></div></section>
<section class="faq section"><p class="eyebrow ink">A FEW LITTLE THINGS</p><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Are there vegetarian dishes?<svg><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p>Absolutely. Explore the paneer tikka, slow-cooked dal makhani and sweet endings. Use “Veg only” in the menu to find them quickly.</p></details><details><summary>What if I have a food allergy?<svg><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p>The dish details show suggested ingredients and common allergens. A live restaurant would need to confirm preparation and cross-contact risks with you before ordering.</p></details><details><summary>Can I plan something for a group?<svg><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p>The table planner supports up to eight people and lets you choose a preferred seating area. This is an interactive design preview; it doesn’t send a booking.</p></details></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="footer-top"><a class="brand" href="#"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="" width="56" height="56"><span>saanjh<span class="brand-dot">.</span><small>INDIAN KITCHEN & COURTYARD</small></span></a><p>Indian at heart.<br>Everyone at the table.</p><a class="text-link" href="#top">Back to the top <svg><use href="#up"/></svg></a></div><div class="footer-word" aria-hidden="true">saanjh<span>✳</span></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>A RESTAURANT CONCEPT BY MAVOCADO DESIGN</span><span>Illustrative menu, place & team names · Generated photography</span><span>© <span id="year"></span> SAANJH</span></div></footer>
